# The second pinned source of the Codex (story 2.8, PRD section 11, FR-16).
#
# Vanilla Pixel Dungeon, read only: the vocabulary diff needs a side to compare this
# fork against, and a forum claim about "a marsupial rat" is a claim about this game,
# not about Shattered Pixel Dungeon. Nothing here is ever built, compiled against, or
# imported by a Shatterfish module; the generator reads its source text and cites it.
#
# The repository carries exactly one tag, so the tag chose itself. GPL-3.0, by Watabou,
# packaged for gradle by 00-Evan. `tools/fetch-vanilla.sh` puts it under `vanilla-src/`,
# which is not committed; continuous integration runs the same script.

